config ST7801N_USE_STATIC_BUFFER
	bool "Use static buffer for DSI transfers"
	help
	  Use a pre-allocated static buffer instead of dynamically allocating
	  temporary buffers for each DSI long packet. This reduces heap fragmentation
	  at the cost of fixed memory usage.

config ST7801N_STATIC_BUF_SIZE
	int "Static buffer size (bytes)"
	depends on ST7801N_USE_STATIC_BUFFER
	default 65535
	help
	  Size of the static buffer used for DSI long packet transfers.
	  Must be at least the maximum DSI payload size (max-dsi-payload property
	  minus one). The default 65535 is the maximum allowed by the DSI specification.